      "function_name": "kibembeHearing",
      "description": "Read a Kibembe (Ebembe) turn against the app's complete Word Bank: the form a sound belongs to, its reading, the language in force, and any correction the person confirms. Send your own last line with the turn as lastAgent, so a person asking for it again \u2014 \"Omo tenda bile?\" \u2014 is given that very line back word for word. Where the turn is one of the app's own saved asks, that ask is handed back with the replies it saves, one of which is the reply: it is given exactly as it stands, never re-worded and never replaced."
